    "detailed_description": "n a post-Lovecraftian wasteland, you are a Bloodhauler.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour machine \u2014 heavy, armored, and fitted with a spiked grinder \u2014 rolls into the fog.<br />\r\nYou crush, slice, and tear through monsters. Blood hits the hood, floods the road.<br />\r\nYou\u2019re not here for glory \u2014 you're here to fill the quota.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou haul back gallons of blood. It\u2019s offloaded. Coins clink.<br />\r\nYou spend them on upgrades: tougher armor, a meaner engine, sharper steel.<br />\r\nAll to survive the next run \u2014 and meet the next quota.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThen it\u2019s back into the unknown. New zones to explore. Rarer beasts to hunt.",
    "about_the_game": "n a post-Lovecraftian wasteland, you are a Bloodhauler.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour machine \u2014 heavy, armored, and fitted with a spiked grinder \u2014 rolls into the fog.<br />\r\nYou crush, slice, and tear through monsters. Blood hits the hood, floods the road.<br />\r\nYou\u2019re not here for glory \u2014 you're here to fill the quota.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou haul back gallons of blood. It\u2019s offloaded. Coins clink.<br />\r\nYou spend them on upgrades: tougher armor, a meaner engine, sharper steel.<br />\r\nAll to survive the next run \u2014 and meet the next quota.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThen it\u2019s back into the unknown. New zones to explore. Rarer beasts to hunt.",
    "short_description": "You\u2019re in a post-Lovecraftian world. A Bloodservant behind the wheel of a cursed chariot. The quota isn\u2019t a suggestion \u2014 miss it, and it\u2019s your blood on the line. Clinking coins upgrade your ride: faster, tougher, deadlier.",
